# North American Resonance Axis — Public Edition v1.0

This release marks the first public publication of the **North American Resonance Axis**, a myth-tech research artifact presented by **LAST OF TRUE TORONTO, LTD.™**.

The v1.0 document establishes the foundational framework linking three landmark towers across North America:

- **Wardenclyffe Tower** (New York)
- **CN Tower** (Toronto)
- **Space Needle** (Seattle)

Through cultural infrastructure analysis, identity physics, and electromagnetic history, this release introduces the Resonance Axis as a public-safe, academically grounded, and symbolically rich interpretive construct.

